{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:PredictedSpectra.LeptonContinuantRecurrence","@type":"LeanModule","name":"PredictedSpectra.LeptonContinuantRecurrence","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.LinearCombination"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.mvNet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.mvNet","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/lepton-continuant-recurrence.lean#L75-L77","doc":"The **net coefficient** `net(T_{2,n}) = a_n + b_n` (sum of all normal\nform terms). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.lepton_continuant_recurrence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.lepton_continuant_recurrence","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/lepton-continuant-recurrence.lean#L55-L73","doc":"**Continuant recurrence for the lepton tower `T_{2,n} = σ₀ⁿ`**\n([`prop:lepton-continuant-recurrence`]).\n\nGiven the Hecke relation `s² = h·s + 1` for `s = σ₀`, the\nGröbner–Shirshov normal form is `sⁿ = a_n·𝟏 + b_n·s`, **derived** by\ninduction on `n` from the relation (so `a_{n+1} = b_n` and\n`b_{n+1} = h·b_n + b_{n-1}`).  The proof reads off the normal form;\nit does not assume it. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:lepton-continuant-recurrence","label":"prop:lepton-continuant-recurrence","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/lepton-continuant-recurrence.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.mvB_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.mvB_succ","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/lepton-continuant-recurrence.lean#L47-L53","doc":"Coupled form of the continuant: `b_{n+1} = a_n + h·b_n`\n(equivalently `b_{n+1} = h·b_n + b_{n-1}` since `a_n = b_{n-1}`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.mvA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.mvA","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/lepton-continuant-recurrence.lean#L41-L45","doc":"The companion sequence `a_n`: `a 0 = 1`, `a (n+1) = b n`\n(i.e. `a_{n+1} = b_n`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.mvB","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.mvB","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/lepton-continuant-recurrence.lean#L34-L39","doc":"Morgan–Voyce continuant `b_n`: `b 0 = 0`, `b 1 = 1`,\n`b (n+2) = h·b(n+1) + b n`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}